#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:12
msgid "Orchestrator"
msgstr "流程编排器"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:1
msgid "MC Solvation Orchestrator."
msgstr "MC 溶剂化流程编排器。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:3
msgid ""
"End-to-end workflow for QPE-driven Monte Carlo solvation simulations. Supports three Hamiltonian "
"modes:"
msgstr "由 QPE 驱动的蒙特卡洛溶剂化模拟的端到端工作流。支持三种哈密顿量模式："

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:6
msgid "hf_corrected: E_HF + E_MM for acceptance, interval-based QPE diagnostics"
msgstr "hf_corrected：使用 E_HF + E_MM 判定是否接受，按间隔执行 QPE 诊断"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:7
msgid "fixed: Compile-once vacuum Hamiltonian, QPE every step"
msgstr "fixed：真空哈密顿量仅编译一次，每步执行 QPE"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:9 q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:8
msgid "dynamic: Per-step MM-embedded Hamiltonian, QPE every step"
msgstr "dynamic：每步使用 MM 嵌入哈密顿量，每步执行 QPE"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator:10
msgid "Usage::"
msgstr "用法::"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.run_solvation:1
msgid "Execute complete MC solvation workflow."
msgstr "执行完整的 MC 溶剂化工作流。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.run_solvation:3
msgid ""
"Workflow: 1. Validate config 2. Initialize solvent ring 3. Compute vacuum HF energy 4. Build QPE "
"circuit (build_qpe_circuit -> QPECircuitBundle) 5. Precompute vacuum cache 6. Create step "
"callback (mode-dependent) 7. Compute initial energy (first step_callback call -> triggers @qjit) "
"8. Create MC loop (create_mc_loop) 9. Execute MC loop 10. Compute Mulliken charges (diagnostic) "
"11. Print statistics + plot (if requested) 12. Return result dict"
msgstr ""
"工作流：1. 验证配置 2. 初始化溶剂环 3. 计算真空 HF 能量 4. 构建 QPE 电路（build_qpe_circuit -> QPECircuitBundle）5. 预计算真空缓存"
" 6. 创建步回调（取决于模式）7. 计算初始能量（首次调用 step_callback -> 触发 @qjit）8. 创建 MC 循环（create_mc_loop）9. 执行 MC 循环 "
"10. 计算 Mulliken 电荷（诊断）11. 打印统计信息并绘图（如有请求）12. 返回结果字典"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.run_solvation:17
msgid "Complete solvation simulation configuration"
msgstr "完整的溶剂化模拟配置"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.run_solvation:18
msgid "Whether to display energy trajectory plots"
msgstr "是否显示能量轨迹图"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.run_solvation:20
msgid "dict with Layer 1 (MCResult) + Layer 2 (orchestrator) fields"
msgstr "包含第 1 层（MCResult）和第 2 层（流程编排器）字段的 dict"

#: of q2m3.solvation.orchestrator.replay_quantum_trajectory:1
msgid "Replay fixed or dynamic quantum evaluations on a saved solvent trajectory."
msgstr "在保存的溶剂轨迹上重放 fixed 或 dynamic 模式的量子评估。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:19
msgid "Circuit Builder"
msgstr "电路构建器"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder:1
msgid "QPE circuit builder for MC solvation simulations."
msgstr "MC 溶剂化模拟的 QPE 电路构建器。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder:3
msgid ""
"Builds parameterized @qjit-compiled QPE circuits that accept Hamiltonian coefficients as runtime "
"arguments. Compile once, call with different coefficients each MC step — avoids 67s recompilation"
" per step."
msgstr "构建由 @qjit 编译的参数化 QPE 电路。电路将哈密顿量系数作为运行时参数接收。仅编译一次后，每个 MC 步用不同系数调用，避免每步重新编译所需的 67 秒。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder:7
msgid ""
"Key Catalyst constraints (POC-validated): - Use X gates instead of qml.BasisState (Catalyst @qjit"
" + ctrl() bug) - TrotterProduct requires check_hermitian=False (JAX tracer incompatible) - "
"MAX_TROTTER_STEPS_RUNTIME caps Trotter steps to avoid MLIR OOM - MSB-first qubit ordering "
"(matching PennyLane QFT convention)"
msgstr ""
"Catalyst 的关键约束（已通过概念验证）：- 使用 X 门代替 qml.BasisState（Catalyst @qjit + ctrl() 存在缺陷）- TrotterProduct "
"必须设置 check_hermitian=False（与 JAX tracer 不兼容）- MAX_TROTTER_STEPS_RUNTIME 限制 Trotter 步数，以避免 MLIR "
"内存不足 - 量子比特采用最高有效位在前的顺序（与 PennyLane QFT 约定一致）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:1
