msgstr "系统量子比特数（= 2 * active_orbitals）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:53
msgid "Number of active spatial orbitals"
msgstr "活性空间轨道数"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:59
msgid "Actual Trotter steps (may be capped)"
msgstr "实际 Trotter 步数（可能受上限限制）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:65
msgid "\"probs\" or \"shots\""
msgstr "\"probs\" 或 \"shots\""

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:71
msgid "True for a zero-arg circuit (fixed mode). False for a circuit that takes coeffs_arr."
msgstr "零参数电路（fixed 模式）为 True；接收 coeffs_arr 的电路为 False。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.QPECircuitBundle:77
msgid "MM embedding mode used to build the fixed operator support"
msgstr "构建固定算符支撑集所用的 MM 嵌入模式"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:1
msgid "Build parameterized QPE circuit accepting runtime coefficients."
msgstr "构建接收运行时系数的参数化 QPE 电路。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:3
msgid ""
"The circuit builder constructs the base Hamiltonian and decomposes it into coefficients and "
"PennyLane operators. It applies the HF energy shift and derives shifted QPE parameters. It caps "
"runtime Trotter depth when needed and returns a ``QPECircuitBundle``. In diagonal mode the base "
"Hamiltonian is vacuum operator support. In ``full_oneelectron`` mode it is a fixed MM operator."
msgstr ""
"电路构建器构造基础哈密顿量，并将其分解为系数和 PennyLane 算符。它施加 HF 能量平移并推导平移后的 QPE 参数。必要时限制运行时 Trotter 深度，并返回 "
"``QPECircuitBundle``。在 diagonal 模式下，基础哈密顿量采用真空算符支撑集。在 ``full_oneelectron`` 模式下，它采用固定 MM 算符。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:9
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:6
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:11
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:11
msgid "Solvation configuration"
msgstr "溶剂化配置"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:10
msgid "QM region coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_atoms, 3)"
msgstr "QM 区域坐标，单位为埃，形状为 (n_atoms, 3)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:11
msgid "HF energy for energy shift and base_time calculation"
msgstr "用于能量平移和 base_time 计算的 HF 能量"

#: of q2m3.solvation.circuit_builder.build_qpe_circuit:13
msgid "QPECircuitBundle with compiled circuit and metadata"
msgstr "包含已编译电路和元数据的 QPECircuitBundle"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:1
msgid "Extract (coeffs, ops) from PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian."
msgstr "从 PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian 中提取 (coeffs, ops)。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:3
msgid ""
"PennyLane 0.44+ returns Sum of SProd from qml.qchem.molecular_hamiltonian. We need separate "
"coefficients and operators for qml.dot(coeffs, ops)."
msgstr ""
"在 PennyLane 0.44+ 中，qml.qchem.molecular_hamiltonian 返回由 SProd 组成的 Sum。qml.dot(coeffs, ops) "
"需要分别传入系数和算符。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:6
msgid "PennyLane Hamiltonian (Sum of SProd operators)"
msgstr "PennyLane 哈密顿量（由 SProd 算符组成的 Sum）"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:8
msgid ""
"Tuple of (coefficients, operators) where coefficients are floats and operators are PennyLane "
"operator instances."
msgstr "(coefficients, operators) 元组，其中系数为浮点数，算符为 PennyLane 算符实例。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:1
msgid "Scan ops to find Identity and single-Z(wire) indices for MM coefficient updates."
msgstr "扫描 ops，查找 Identity 和单 Z(wire) 的索引，以更新 MM 系数。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:3
msgid ""
"If any Z(wire) for wire in range(n_system_qubits) is missing, appends a coeff=0.0 placeholder to "
"ensure all spin orbitals can receive MM corrections."
msgstr "如果 range(n_system_qubits) 中任一 wire 缺少 Z(wire)，则追加 coeff=0.0 的占位项，确保所有自旋轨道都能接收 MM 修正。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:6
msgid "List of PennyLane operators (from decompose_hamiltonian)"
msgstr "PennyLane 算符列表（来自 decompose_hamiltonian）"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:8
msgid "Corresponding coefficient list (may be extended)"
msgstr "对应的系数列表（可能会扩展）"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"- index_map: {\"identity_idx\": int, \"z_wire_idx\": {wire: idx, ...}} - extended_coeffs: "
"coefficients with any missing Z terms appended - extended_ops: operators with any missing Z terms"
" appended"
msgstr ""
"- index_map: {\"identity_idx\": int, \"z_wire_idx\": {wire: idx, ...}} - extended_coeffs: 追加缺失 Z "
"项后的系数 - extended_ops: 追加缺失 Z 项后的算符"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid "index_map: {\"identity_idx\": int, \"z_wire_idx\": {wire: idx, ...}}"
msgstr "index_map: {\"identity_idx\": int, \"z_wire_idx\": {wire: idx, ...}}"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:11
msgid "extended_coeffs: coefficients with any missing Z terms appended"
msgstr "extended_coeffs: 追加缺失 Z 项后的系数"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:12
msgid "extended_ops: operators with any missing Z terms appended"
msgstr "extended_ops: 追加缺失 Z 项后的算符"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:26
msgid "Energy Callbacks"
msgstr "能量回调"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:1
msgid "Energy computation module for MC solvation simulations."
msgstr "MC 溶剂化模拟的能量计算模块。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:3
msgid ""
"Provides vacuum caching, three-mode coefficient callbacks, and step callback factories for QPE-"
"driven Monte Carlo solvation energy evaluation."
msgstr "提供真空缓存、三模式系数回调和步回调工厂，用于由 QPE 驱动的蒙特卡洛溶剂化能量评估。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:6
msgid "Three Hamiltonian modes:"
msgstr "三种哈密顿量模式："

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:7
msgid "hf_corrected: HF energy for MC acceptance, interval-based QPE diagnostics"
msgstr "hf_corrected：使用 HF 能量判定 MC 是否接受，按间隔执行 QPE 诊断"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:8
msgid "fixed: Compile-once vacuum coefficients, QPE every step"
msgstr "fixed：真空系数仅编译一次，每步执行 QPE"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy:11
msgid ""
"All step callbacks are pure Python (not @qjit); they invoke pre-compiled @qjit circuits "
"internally (ADR-003)."
msgstr "所有步回调均为纯 Python 函数（未使用 @qjit）；它们在内部调用预编译的 @qjit 电路（ADR-003）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.StepResult:1
msgid "Result from one MC step's energy computation."
msgstr "一次 MC 步的能量计算结果。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.precompute_vacuum_cache:1
msgid "Run vacuum SCF once and cache results for MC loop."
msgstr "运行一次真空 SCF，并缓存结果供 MC 循环使用。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.precompute_vacuum_cache:3
msgid "Solvation configuration with molecule definition"
msgstr "包含分子定义的溶剂化配置"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.precompute_vacuum_cache:5
msgid "h_core_vac, mo_coeff, mo_coeff_active, energy_nuc_vac, e_vacuum, active_idx"
msgstr "h_core_vac, mo_coeff, mo_coeff_active, energy_nuc_vac, e_vacuum, active_idx"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:1
msgid "Factory: create coefficient update callback for the configured mode."
msgstr "工厂：为配置的模式创建系数更新回调。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:3
msgid ""
"For \"hf_corrected\" / \"fixed\": returns base_coeffs unchanged. For \"dynamic\": runs solvated "
"SCF, computes delta, patches coefficients."
msgstr "对于 \"hf_corrected\" / \"fixed\"：返回未修改的 base_coeffs。对于 \"dynamic\"：运行溶剂化 SCF，计算差值并更新系数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:7
msgid "QPE circuit bundle with base_coeffs and op_index_map"
msgstr "包含 base_coeffs 和 op_index_map 的 QPE 电路对象包"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:8
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:12
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:12
msgid "Pre-computed vacuum data"
msgstr "预计算的真空数据"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_coefficient_callback:10
msgid "(solvent_states, qm_coords_flat) -> np.ndarray[n_terms]"
msgstr "(solvent_states, qm_coords_flat) -> np.ndarray[n_terms]"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:1
msgid "Factory: create per-step energy computation callback (fixed/dynamic modes)."
msgstr "工厂：创建每步能量计算回调（fixed/dynamic 模式）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:3
msgid ""
"Internal pipeline: 1. coefficient_callback → new_coeffs 2. "
"compiled_circuit(jnp.array(new_coeffs)) → measurement_result 3. "
"phase_extraction(measurement_result) → e_qpe 4. compute_mm_energy(solvents) → e_mm_sol_sol 5. "
"Return StepResult"
msgstr ""
"内部流程：1. coefficient_callback → new_coeffs 2. compiled_circuit(jnp.array(new_coeffs)) → "
"measurement_result 3. phase_extraction(measurement_result) → e_qpe 4. compute_mm_energy(solvents)"
" → e_mm_sol_sol 5. 返回 StepResult"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:10
msgid "QPE circuit bundle with compiled circuit"
msgstr "包含已编译电路的 QPE 电路对象包"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:17
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.create_step_callback:14
msgid "(solvent_states, qm_coords_flat) -> StepResult"
msgstr "(solvent_states, qm_coords_flat) -> StepResult"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:1
msgid "Factory: hf_corrected mode step callback with deferred compilation."
msgstr "工厂：创建延迟编译的 hf_corrected 模式步回调。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:3
msgid ""
"Every step: PySCF QMMM → e_hf_ref; compute_mm_energy → e_mm. Every qpe_interval steps: "
"additionally run QPE circuit for diagnostics."
msgstr "每步：PySCF QMMM → e_hf_ref；compute_mm_energy → e_mm。每隔 qpe_interval 步：额外运行 QPE 电路进行诊断。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:6
msgid ""
"If circuit_bundle is None, QPE circuit is lazily built on the first QPE step (deferred "
"compilation — avoids startup compilation cost)."
msgstr "如果 circuit_bundle 为 None，则在首个 QPE 步按需构建 QPE 电路（延迟编译，避免启动时的编译开销）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:9
msgid "Non-QPE steps return StepResult(e_qpe=NaN, qpe_time=0.0)."
msgstr "非 QPE 步返回 StepResult(e_qpe=NaN, qpe_time=0.0)。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:13
msgid "QM coordinates array for circuit building"
msgstr "用于构建电路的 QM 坐标数组"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:14
msgid "Vacuum HF energy for energy shift"
msgstr "用于能量平移的真空 HF 能量"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.create_hf_corrected_step_callback:15
msgid "Optional pre-built circuit bundle (None = deferred)"
msgstr "可选的预构建电路对象包（None = 延迟构建）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_vacuum:1
msgid "Compute vacuum HF energy for the QM region."
msgstr "计算 QM 区域的真空 HF 能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_vacuum:5
msgid "Vacuum HF energy in Hartree"
msgstr "真空 HF 能量，单位为 Hartree"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_solvated:1
msgid "Compute solvated HF energy with MM electrostatic embedding."
msgstr "计算含 MM 静电嵌入的溶剂化 HF 能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_solvated:3
#: q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_mulliken_charges:3
msgid "QM region molecular configuration"
msgstr "QM 区域的分子配置"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_solvated:4
msgid "List of solvent molecules (MM region)"
msgstr "溶剂分子列表（MM 区域）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_hf_energy_solvated:6
msgid "Solvated HF energy in Hartree"
msgstr "溶剂化 HF 能量，单位为 Hartree"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_mulliken_charges:1
msgid "Compute Mulliken charges for vacuum or solvated geometry."
msgstr "计算真空或溶剂化构型的 Mulliken 电荷。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_mulliken_charges:4
msgid "Optional solvent state array (n_mol, 6). Use None for vacuum."
msgstr "可选的溶剂状态数组 (n_mol, 6)。真空情况使用 None。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.energy.compute_mulliken_charges:6
msgid "mulliken_charge}, e.g. {\"O0\": -0.45, \"H1\": +0.22}"
msgstr "mulliken_charge}，例如 {\"O0\": -0.45, \"H1\": +0.22}"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:33
msgid "Monte Carlo Loop"
msgstr "蒙特卡洛循环"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop:1
msgid "Monte Carlo loop for QPE-driven solvation simulations."
msgstr "由 QPE 驱动的溶剂化模拟的蒙特卡洛循环。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop:3
msgid ""
"Implements a pure-Python Metropolis MC loop (ADR-003: no @qjit) that delegates energy evaluation "
"to pre-compiled step callbacks."
msgstr "实现纯 Python 的 Metropolis MC 循环（ADR-003：不使用 @qjit），将能量评估交给预编译的步回调。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop:6
msgid "Three Hamiltonian modes determine acceptance energy:"
msgstr "三种哈密顿量模式决定接受判据所用的能量："

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop:7
msgid "hf_corrected: E_HF_ref + E_MM(sol-sol)  (fast, approximate)"
msgstr "hf_corrected：E_HF_ref + E_MM(sol-sol)（快速，近似）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop:8
msgid "fixed / dynamic: E_QPE + E_MM(sol-sol)   (full quantum)"
msgstr "fixed / dynamic：E_QPE + E_MM(sol-sol)（完整量子计算）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.MCResult:1
msgid "Complete MC simulation result."
msgstr "完整的 MC 模拟结果。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.create_mc_loop:1
msgid "Factory: create QPE-driven MC loop (pure Python)."
msgstr "工厂：创建由 QPE 驱动的 MC 循环（纯 Python）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.create_mc_loop:3
msgid "Returns a closure that runs the MC simulation with Metropolis acceptance."
msgstr "返回使用 Metropolis 接受准则运行 MC 模拟的闭包。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.create_mc_loop:5
msgid "Solvation simulation configuration."
msgstr "溶剂化模拟配置。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.create_mc_loop:6
msgid "Energy evaluator for each MC trial. Signature: (solvent_states, qm_coords) -> StepResult"
msgstr "每次 MC 尝试的能量评估函数。签名：(solvent_states, qm_coords) -> StepResult"

#: of q2m3.solvation.mc_loop.create_mc_loop:9
msgid "mc_loop(initial_solvents, qm_coords, seed, initial_energy) -> MCResult"
msgstr "mc_loop(initial_solvents, qm_coords, seed, initial_energy) -> MCResult"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:40
msgid "Phase Extraction"
msgstr "相位提取"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:1
msgid "Phase extraction utilities for QPE measurement results."
msgstr "从 QPE 测量结果中提取相位的工具。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:3
msgid "Pure NumPy implementation — no PennyLane, Catalyst, or JAX dependencies."
msgstr "纯 NumPy 实现，不依赖 PennyLane、Catalyst 或 JAX。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:5
msgid "Two extraction modes:"
msgstr "两种提取模式："

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:6
msgid ""
"Analytical (probs): probability-weighted expected bin, preserving sub-bin sensitivity (~0.1 mHa) "
"compared to argmax (~12 mHa for 4-bit QPE)."
msgstr "解析模式（probs）：计算概率加权的预期分箱索引。与 argmax（4 位 QPE 约为 12 mHa）相比，可保留小于分箱宽度的灵敏度（约 0.1 mHa）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:8
msgid ""
"Shots-based (samples): decode each bitstring to a bin index, then compute energy statistics "
"across shots."
msgstr "采样模式（samples）：将每个比特串解码为分箱索引，再计算各次测量的能量统计量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:11
msgid "Core formula (shared):"
msgstr "共用的核心公式："

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction:12
msgid "phase = expected_bin / n_bins energy = -2π · phase / base_time + energy_shift"
msgstr "phase = expected_bin / n_bins energy = -2π · phase / base_time + energy_shift"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:1
msgid "Extract energy from analytical probability distribution."
msgstr "从解析概率分布中提取能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:3
msgid "Uses the probability-weighted mean of bin indices. The mean can lie between integer bins."
msgstr "使用分箱索引的概率加权平均值。平均值可以位于整数分箱索引之间。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:5
msgid "Probability array of shape (2^n_estimation_wires,)."
msgstr "形状为 (2^n_estimation_wires,) 的概率数组。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:6
#: q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:8
msgid "Base evolution time for phase-to-energy conversion."
msgstr "用于将相位转换为能量的基本演化时间。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:7
#: q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:9
msgid "Energy offset applied to the Hamiltonian."
msgstr "施加于哈密顿量的能量偏移量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:8
#: q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:10
msgid "Number of QPE estimation qubits."
msgstr "QPE 估计量子比特数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_probs:10
msgid "Estimated energy in Hartree."
msgstr "估计能量，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:1
msgid "Extract energy from shots-based measurement samples."
msgstr "从测量采样中提取能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:3
msgid ""
"Each row of *samples* is a bitstring (MSB-first) that encodes a bin index. All per-shot energies "
"are computed, then either the mean or a statistics dict is returned."
msgstr "*samples* 的每一行都是一个编码分箱索引的比特串（最高有效位在前）。计算每次测量的能量后，返回平均值或统计字典。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:7
msgid "Binary array of shape (n_shots, n_estimation_wires)."
msgstr "形状为 (n_shots, n_estimation_wires) 的二进制数组。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:11
msgid "If True, return dict with mean, std, sem, n_shots."
msgstr "如果为 True，则返回包含 mean、std、sem 和 n_shots 的字典。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:13
msgid "Mean energy (float) or statistics dict."
msgstr "平均能量（float）或统计字典。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

#: of q2m3.solvation.phase_extraction.extract_energy_from_shots:15
msgid "If samples is empty."
msgstr "samples 为空时。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:46
msgid "Solvent Models"
msgstr "溶剂模型"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:1
msgid "Explicit Solvent Models for QM/MM Simulations"
msgstr "QM/MM 模拟的显式溶剂模型"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:3
msgid ""
"This module provides data-driven solvent model definitions for use with PySCF's qmmm module. It "
"focuses on: 1. Solvent geometry and partial charges (for pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge) 2. Rigid body "
"coordinate transformations 3. Classical MM energy for solvent-solvent interactions (MC "
"acceptance)"
msgstr ""
"本模块提供数据驱动的溶剂模型定义，供 PySCF 的 qmmm 模块使用。主要包括：1. 溶剂几何结构和部分电荷（用于 pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge）2. 刚体坐标变换 3. "
"溶剂间相互作用的经典 MM 能量（用于 MC 接受判定）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:9
msgid "Design Philosophy:"
msgstr "设计原则："

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:10
msgid "Data-driven: Solvent models defined as dataclasses, easy to extend"
msgstr "数据驱动：使用数据类定义溶剂模型，便于扩展"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:11
msgid "PySCF-compatible: Output coordinates in Angstrom for qmmm.mm_charge"
msgstr "兼容 PySCF：为 qmmm.mm_charge 输出以埃为单位的坐标"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:12
msgid "Minimal: Only implement what PySCF doesn't provide directly"
msgstr "最小实现：仅实现 PySCF 未直接提供的功能"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:14 q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:9
msgid "Usage with PySCF:"
msgstr "与 PySCF 配合使用："

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:15
msgid "from pyscf import qmmm"
msgstr "from pyscf import qmmm"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:17
msgid ""
"model = TIP3P_WATER molecules = [SolventMolecule(model, pos, angles) for ...] mm_coords, "
"mm_charges = get_mm_embedding_data(molecules)"
msgstr ""
"model = TIP3P_WATER molecules = [SolventMolecule(model, pos, angles) for ...] mm_coords, "
"mm_charges = get_mm_embedding_data(molecules)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent:21
msgid ""
"# Convert to Bohr for PySCF mm_coords_bohr = mm_coords * ANGSTROM_TO_BOHR mf = qmmm.mm_charge(mf,"
" mm_coords_bohr, mm_charges)"
msgstr ""
"# Convert to Bohr for PySCF mm_coords_bohr = mm_coords * ANGSTROM_TO_BOHR mf = qmmm.mm_charge(mf,"
" mm_coords_bohr, mm_charges)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:1
msgid "Single atom in a solvent model."
msgstr "溶剂模型中的单个原子。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:5
msgid "Atomic symbol (e.g., \"O\", \"H\")"
msgstr "原子符号（例如 \"O\"、\"H\"）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:11
msgid "Position in molecule-fixed frame (Angstrom)"
msgstr "分子固定坐标系中的位置（埃）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:13
msgid "tuple[float, float, float]"
msgstr "tuple[float, float, float]"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:17
msgid "Partial charge (elementary charge units)"
msgstr "部分电荷（以元电荷为单位）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:23
msgid "Lennard-Jones sigma parameter (Angstrom), 0 if no LJ"
msgstr "Lennard-Jones sigma 参数（埃）；无 LJ 时为 0"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom:29
msgid "Lennard-Jones epsilon parameter (kcal/mol), 0 if no LJ"
msgstr "Lennard-Jones epsilon 参数（kcal/mol）；无 LJ 时为 0"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:1
msgid "Solvent model definition containing geometry, charges, and LJ parameters."
msgstr "包含几何结构、电荷和 LJ 参数的溶剂模型定义。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:3
msgid ""
"This is an immutable data structure that defines a solvent type. Actual solvent molecule "
"instances are represented by SolventMolecule."
msgstr "这是定义溶剂类型的不可变数据结构。实际的溶剂分子实例由 SolventMolecule 表示。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:8
msgid "Model identifier (e.g., \"TIP3P\", \"SPC/E\")"
msgstr "模型标识符（例如 \"TIP3P\"、\"SPC/E\"）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:14
msgid "Tuple of SolventAtom defining the molecule structure"
msgstr "定义分子结构的 SolventAtom 元组"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:16
msgid "tuple[q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom, ...]"
msgstr "tuple[q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventAtom, ...]"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel:20
msgid "Literature reference for the model parameters"
msgstr "模型参数的文献引用"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel.local_coords:1
msgid "Local coordinates as (n_atoms, 3) array."
msgstr "以 (n_atoms, 3) 数组表示的局部坐标。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel.get_lj_params:1
msgid "Get (sigma, epsilon) for atom at given index."
msgstr "获取指定索引原子的 (sigma, epsilon)。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule:1
msgid "A solvent molecule instance with position and orientation."
msgstr "具有位置和取向的溶剂分子实例。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule:5
msgid "The solvent model (defines geometry and parameters)"
msgstr "溶剂模型（定义几何结构和参数）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule:7
msgid "q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel"
msgstr "q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventModel"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule:11
msgid "Center of mass position in Angstrom"
msgstr "质心位置，单位为埃"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule:17
msgid "Orientation as (roll, pitch, yaw) in radians"
msgstr "以 (roll, pitch, yaw) 表示的取向，单位为弧度"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule.get_atom_coords:1
msgid "Get global coordinates of all atoms."
msgstr "获取所有原子的全局坐标。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule.get_atom_coords:3
msgid "Array of shape (n_atoms, 3) in Angstrom"
msgstr "形状为 (n_atoms, 3) 的数组，单位为埃"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule.get_charges:1
msgid "Get partial charges for all atoms."
msgstr "获取所有原子的部分电荷。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule.to_state_vector:1
msgid "Convert to state vector [x, y, z, roll, pitch, yaw]."
msgstr "转换为状态向量 [x, y, z, roll, pitch, yaw]。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.SolventMolecule.from_state_vector:1
msgid "Create molecule from state vector."
msgstr "从状态向量创建分子。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:1
msgid "Extract MM embedding data for pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge()."
msgstr "为 pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge() 提取 MM 嵌入数据。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.compute_mm_energy:9 q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:3
msgid "Sequence of SolventMolecule instances"
msgstr "SolventMolecule 实例序列"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:5
msgid ""
"- coords: Atom coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_total_atoms, 3) - charges: Partial charges, "
"shape (n_total_atoms,)"
msgstr "- coords: 原子坐标，单位为埃，形状为 (n_total_atoms, 3) - charges: 部分电荷，形状为 (n_total_atoms,)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:5
msgid "coords: Atom coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_total_atoms, 3)"
msgstr "coords: 原子坐标，单位为埃，形状为 (n_total_atoms, 3)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:6
msgid "charges: Partial charges, shape (n_total_atoms,)"
msgstr "charges: 部分电荷，形状为 (n_total_atoms,)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data:10
msgid ""
"coords, charges = get_mm_embedding_data(molecules) coords_bohr = coords * ANGSTROM_TO_BOHR mf = "
"qmmm.mm_charge(mf, coords_bohr, charges)"
msgstr ""
"coords, charges = get_mm_embedding_data(molecules) coords_bohr = coords * ANGSTROM_TO_BOHR mf = "
"qmmm.mm_charge(mf, coords_bohr, charges)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data_bohr:1
msgid "Get MM embedding data with coordinates in Bohr (ready for PySCF)."
msgstr "获取坐标以 Bohr 为单位的 MM 嵌入数据（可直接用于 PySCF）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data_bohr:3
msgid ""
"This is a convenience function that converts coordinates to Bohr, which is the unit expected by "
"pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge()."
msgstr "此便捷函数将坐标转换为 Bohr，即 pyscf.qmmm.mm_charge() 所需的单位。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.get_mm_embedding_data_bohr:6
msgid "Tuple of (coords_bohr, charges)"
msgstr "(coords_bohr, charges) 元组"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.compute_mm_energy:1
msgid "Compute classical MM energy between solvent molecules."
msgstr "计算溶剂分子之间的经典 MM 能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.compute_mm_energy:3
msgid ""
"This calculates the Lennard-Jones and Coulomb interactions between all pairs of solvent "
"molecules. Used for the MC acceptance criterion."
msgstr "计算所有溶剂分子对之间的 Lennard-Jones 和库仑相互作用，用于 MC 接受准则。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.compute_mm_energy:6
msgid ""
"Note: This is a simple pairwise implementation. For production use with large systems, consider "
"using OpenMM or other optimized libraries."
msgstr "注意：这是简单的成对计算实现。大型体系的实际计算可考虑使用 OpenMM 或其他优化库。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.compute_mm_energy:11
msgid ""
"Total MM energy in Hartree. Exact intermolecular atom overlap is treated as a hard-core invalid "
"configuration and returns +inf."
msgstr "总 MM 能量，单位为 Hartree。不同分子的原子完全重合时，将该构型视为违反硬核约束的无效构型，并返回 +inf。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:1
msgid "Initialize solvent molecules in a ring arrangement."
msgstr "将溶剂分子初始化为环形排列。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:3
msgid "Molecules are placed equidistant in a ring in the x-y plane, with random initial orientations."
msgstr "分子等间距排列在 x-y 平面的环上，初始取向随机。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:6
msgid "Solvent model to use"
msgstr "使用的溶剂模型"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:7
msgid "Number of molecules"
msgstr "分子数"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:8
msgid "Center of the ring (typically solute center)"
msgstr "环中心（通常为溶质中心）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:9
msgid "Ring radius in Angstrom"
msgstr "环半径，单位为埃"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:10
msgid "Random seed for reproducible orientations"
msgstr "用于复现取向的随机种子"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.initialize_solvent_ring:12
msgid "List of SolventMolecule instances"
msgstr "SolventMolecule 实例列表"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.molecules_to_state_array:1
msgid "Convert list of molecules to state array of shape (n_mol, 6)."
msgstr "将分子列表转换为形状为 (n_mol, 6) 的状态数组。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.solvent.state_array_to_molecules:1
msgid "Convert state array to list of molecules."
msgstr "将状态数组转换为分子列表。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:53
msgid "IR Cache"
msgstr "IR 缓存"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache:1
msgid "Catalyst LLVM IR cache for QPE circuit compilation."
msgstr "用于 QPE 电路编译的 Catalyst LLVM IR 缓存。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache:3
msgid "Implements two-phase compilation caching:"
msgstr "实现两阶段编译缓存："

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache:4
msgid ""
"Phase A (cache miss): Subprocess full @qjit(keep_intermediate=True) -> save LLVM IR Phase B "
"(cache hit):  replace_ir + jit_compile -> skip MLIR pipeline (~5x faster)"
msgstr ""
"阶段 A（缓存未命中）：子进程完整运行 @qjit(keep_intermediate=True) -> 保存 LLVM IR 阶段 B（缓存命中）：replace_ir + "
"jit_compile -> 跳过 MLIR 流水线（速度约为原来的 5 倍）"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache:7
msgid ""
"Cache key = circuit topology parameters only. Runtime Hamiltonian coefficients do not affect LLVM"
" IR structure, so IR compiled for n_waters=5 is valid for n_waters=20. Fixed full-one-electron "
"embedding can change operator support, so embedding_mode is part of the key."
msgstr ""
"缓存键仅包含电路拓扑参数。运行时哈密顿量系数不影响 LLVM IR 结构，因此为 n_waters=5 编译的 IR 也适用于 "
"n_waters=20。固定的完整单电子嵌入可能改变算符支撑集，因此 embedding_mode 是缓存键的一部分。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.default_cache_dir:1
msgid "Find project root (containing pyproject.toml) and return cache dir."
msgstr "查找项目根目录（包含 pyproject.toml），并返回缓存目录。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.compute_cache_key:1
msgid "Generate deterministic cache key from circuit topology parameters."
msgstr "根据电路拓扑参数生成确定性的缓存键。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.compute_cache_key:3
msgid ""
"The key encodes parameters that affect LLVM IR structure: - Molecule identity (name, basis, "
"active space) - QPE circuit parameters (estimation wires, Trotter steps, shots) - Hamiltonian "
"circuit style and embedding operator support"
msgstr "缓存键编码影响 LLVM IR 结构的参数：- 分子标识（名称、基组、活性空间）- QPE 电路参数（估计量子线、Trotter 步数、测量次数）- 哈密顿量电路形式及嵌入算符支撑集"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.compute_cache_key:8
msgid ""
"Parameters that only affect runtime coefficient values (n_waters, temperature, coordinates) are "
"NOT included."
msgstr "仅影响运行时系数值的参数（n_waters、temperature、coordinates）不包含在内。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.cache_path_for_config:1
msgid "Return the full path for the cached IR file."
msgstr "返回缓存 IR 文件的完整路径。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.is_cache_available:1
msgid "Check if a valid cache file exists for this config."
msgstr "检查此配置是否存在有效缓存文件。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:1
msgid "Cache-aware QPE circuit compilation resolution."
msgstr "根据缓存状态确定 QPE 电路的编译方式。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:3
msgid ""
"On cache hit:  replace_ir + jit_compile (seconds) On cache miss: subprocess full compile -> save "
"IR -> replace_ir + jit_compile"
msgstr "缓存命中时：replace_ir + jit_compile（数秒）缓存未命中时：子进程完整编译 -> 保存 IR -> replace_ir + jit_compile"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:6
msgid "The bundle's compiled_circuit is modified in-place by replace_ir."
msgstr "replace_ir 会原位修改对象包的 compiled_circuit。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:8
msgid "Solvation configuration with cache settings"
msgstr "包含缓存设置的溶剂化配置"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:9
msgid "QPECircuitBundle from build_qpe_circuit()"
msgstr "来自 build_qpe_circuit() 的 QPECircuitBundle"

#: of q2m3.solvation.ir_cache.resolve_compiled_circuit:11
msgid "(bundle, cache_stats) — bundle is the same object (replace_ir modifies in-place)"
msgstr "(bundle, cache_stats)；bundle 仍为同一个对象（replace_ir 原位修改）"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:59
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "分析"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis:1
msgid "Solvation analysis functions for δ_corr-pol and related statistics."
msgstr "δ_corr-pol 及相关统计量的溶剂化分析函数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis:3
msgid ""
"Pure NumPy module — no Catalyst or JAX dependency. All public functions are pure functions: take "
"NumPy arrays, return frozen dataclasses."
msgstr "纯 NumPy 模块，不依赖 Catalyst 或 JAX。所有公共函数均为纯函数：接收 NumPy 数组，返回冻结数据类。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.DeltaCorrPolResult:1
msgid "δ_corr-pol analysis result."
msgstr "δ_corr-pol 分析结果。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.DeltaCorrPolResult:3
msgid ""
"Note: frozen=True prevents field reassignment but does NOT prevent mutation of mutable fields "
"like np.ndarray (e.g., obj.per_step_delta[0] = 999 is still possible). This is an accepted trade-"
"off. frozen provides intent-level immutability and hashability for simple fields. ndarray copy-"
"on-read is not enforced to avoid performance overhead on large arrays. Consumers should treat all"
" fields as read-only."
msgstr ""
"注意：frozen=True 防止对字段重新赋值，但不能防止修改 np.ndarray 等可变字段（例如仍可执行 obj.per_step_delta[0] = "
"999）。这是已接受的权衡。frozen 表达不可变的设计意图，并使简单字段可哈希。为避免大数组的性能开销，读取 ndarray 时不强制复制。使用者应将所有字段视为只读。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.EnergyPhaseResult:1
msgid "Energy trend phase analysis result (early vs late phase)."
msgstr "能量趋势阶段分析结果（早期与晚期阶段）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.QPEHFConsistencyResult:1
msgid "QPE-HF trajectory consistency metrics."
msgstr "QPE-HF 轨迹一致性指标。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.EquilibrationResult:1
msgid "Equilibration diagnostic result (windowed monotonicity)."
msgstr "平衡诊断结果（基于窗口的单调性）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.ModeComparisonResult:1
msgid "Full three-mode comparison analysis result."
msgstr "完整的三模式比较分析结果。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:1
msgid "Compute per-step δ_corr-pol from paired fixed/dynamic QPE energies."
msgstr "从成对的 fixed/dynamic QPE 能量计算每步 δ_corr-pol。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:3
msgid "δ_corr-pol(R) = E_QPE(dynamic, R) - E_QPE(fixed, R)"
msgstr "δ_corr-pol(R) = E_QPE(dynamic, R) - E_QPE(fixed, R)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:4
msgid "≈ E_corr(solvated, R) - E_corr(vacuum)"
msgstr "≈ E_corr(solvated, R) - E_corr(vacuum)"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:6
msgid "QPE energies from fixed Hamiltonian mode."
msgstr "fixed 哈密顿量模式的 QPE 能量。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:7
msgid "QPE energies from dynamic Hamiltonian mode. Must be the same length as quantum_energies_fixed."
msgstr "dynamic 哈密顿量模式的 QPE 能量。长度必须与 quantum_energies_fixed 相同。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_delta_corr_pol:10
msgid "DeltaCorrPolResult with paired-sample statistics."
msgstr "包含配对样本统计量的 DeltaCorrPolResult。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.analyze_energy_phases:1
msgid "Analyze early/late energy trends across MC sampling phases."
msgstr "分析 MC 采样阶段的早期/晚期能量趋势。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.analyze_energy_phases:3
msgid ""
"Splits the energy trajectory into n_phases equal segments and compares the first (early) and last"
" (late) segments."
msgstr "将能量轨迹等分为 n_phases 段，并比较首段（早期）和末段（晚期）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.analyze_energy_phases:6
msgid "Energy trajectory from QPE-driven MC simulation."
msgstr "由 QPE 驱动的 MC 模拟的能量轨迹。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.analyze_energy_phases:7
msgid "Number of phases to divide the trajectory into."
msgstr "将轨迹划分的阶段数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.analyze_energy_phases:9
msgid "EnergyPhaseResult with mean and std for early and late phases."
msgstr "包含早期和晚期阶段均值及标准差的 EnergyPhaseResult。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_qpe_hf_consistency:1
msgid "Compute QPE-HF trajectory consistency metrics."
msgstr "计算 QPE-HF 轨迹一致性指标。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_qpe_hf_consistency:3
msgid ""
"Measures how well the QPE and HF energy trajectories track each other. A positive, high Pearson "
"correlation indicates consistent trends."
msgstr "衡量 QPE 和 HF 能量轨迹的同步变化程度。较高的正 Pearson 相关系数表明趋势一致。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_qpe_hf_consistency:6
#: q2m3.solvation.analysis.detect_equilibration:6
msgid "QPE energy trajectory."
msgstr "QPE 能量轨迹。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_qpe_hf_consistency:7
msgid "HF energy trajectory (same length as quantum_energies)."
msgstr "HF 能量轨迹（长度与 quantum_energies 相同）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.compute_qpe_hf_consistency:9
msgid "QPEHFConsistencyResult with offset and correlation statistics."
msgstr "包含偏移量和相关统计量的 QPEHFConsistencyResult。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.detect_equilibration:1
msgid "Windowed monotonicity diagnostic for MC equilibration."
msgstr "用于 MC 平衡判断的窗口单调性诊断。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.detect_equilibration:3
msgid ""
"Splits energies into 5 equal windows and checks if window means are monotonically decreasing "
"(suggesting non-equilibration)."
msgstr "将能量等分为 5 个窗口，检查窗口均值是否单调递减（提示尚未达到平衡）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.detect_equilibration:7
msgid "Minimum number of samples required. Returns None if len(quantum_energies) < min_samples."
msgstr "所需的最少样本数。如果 len(quantum_energies) < min_samples，则返回 None。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.detect_equilibration:10
msgid "EquilibrationResult, or None if insufficient samples."
msgstr "EquilibrationResult；样本不足时返回 None。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:1
msgid "Orchestrate full three-mode comparison analysis."
msgstr "编排完整的三模式比较分析。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:3
msgid ""
"Combines lower-level analysis functions to produce a complete ModeComparisonResult from "
"run_solvation() return dicts."
msgstr "组合底层分析函数，根据 run_solvation() 返回的字典生成完整的 ModeComparisonResult。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:6
msgid "run_solvation() result dict for fixed Hamiltonian mode."
msgstr "fixed 哈密顿量模式的 run_solvation() 结果字典。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:7
msgid "run_solvation() result dict for dynamic Hamiltonian mode."
msgstr "dynamic 哈密顿量模式的 run_solvation() 结果字典。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:8
msgid "Optional result dict for hf_corrected mode."
msgstr "可选的 hf_corrected 模式结果字典。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:9
msgid "Vacuum reference energy (Ha) for Trotter bias calculation."
msgstr "用于计算 Trotter 偏差的真空参考能量（Ha）。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:11
msgid "ModeComparisonResult with all analysis fields populated."
msgstr "所有分析字段均已填充的 ModeComparisonResult。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison:13
msgid "If any result dict is missing required keys."
msgstr "任一结果字典缺少必需键时。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/solvation.rst:66
msgid "Structure Analysis"
msgstr "结构分析"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis:1
msgid "Internal structure-analysis helpers for finite-shell solvation outputs."
msgstr "用于有限溶剂壳层输出的内部结构分析工具。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis:3
msgid ""
"The routines in this module are pure NumPy/CSV helpers around the solvent state arrays already "
"returned by :func:`q2m3.solvation.run_solvation`. They are kept out of "
"``q2m3.solvation.__init__`` because they support optional post-processing workflows rather than "
"the primary solvation API."
msgstr ""
"本模块中的例程是纯 NumPy/CSV 工具，用于处理 :func:`q2m3.solvation.run_solvation` "
"已返回的溶剂状态数组。这些例程支持可选的后处理工作流，而非主要溶剂化 API，因此不加入 ``q2m3.solvation.__init__``。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.RadialProfile:1
msgid "Finite-shell oxygen radial-density profile around a solute center."
msgstr "溶质中心周围有限溶剂壳层中的氧原子径向密度分布。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.RadialProfile.bin_centers:1
msgid "Bin centers in Angstrom."
msgstr "分箱中心，单位为埃。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.validate_state_trajectory:1
msgid "Return a float trajectory array with shape ``(n_steps, n_waters, 6)``."
msgstr "返回形状为 ``(n_steps, n_waters, 6)`` 的浮点轨迹数组。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.write_state_trajectory_csv:1
msgid "Write solvent states as a long-form CSV for deterministic round-trips."
msgstr "将溶剂状态写为长格式 CSV，以支持确定性的往返读写。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.load_state_trajectory_csv:1
msgid "Load a solvent-state trajectory CSV."
msgstr "加载溶剂状态轨迹 CSV。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.load_state_trajectory_csv:3
msgid ""
"The preferred schema is long-form ``step,water_index,x,y,z,roll,pitch,yaw``. A compact wide "
"schema with columns like ``water_0_x`` or ``w0_x`` is also accepted for compatibility with ad hoc"
" notebook exports."
msgstr ""
"首选模式是长格式 ``step,water_index,x,y,z,roll,pitch,yaw``。为兼容临时 notebook 导出，也接受包含 ``water_0_x`` 或 "
"``w0_x`` 等列的紧凑宽格式。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.solute_center:1
msgid "Return the arithmetic center of solute coordinates."
msgstr "返回溶质坐标的算术中心。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.water_oxygen_distances:1
msgid "Return oxygen-center distances to the solute center for every frame/water."
msgstr "返回每帧中每个水分子的氧原子中心到溶质中心的距离。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.radial_density_profile:1
msgid "Compute finite-shell oxygen radial density and cumulative coordination."
msgstr "计算有限溶剂壳层中的氧原子径向密度和累积配位数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.shell_counts_per_frame:1
msgid "Return per-frame water counts within ``cutoff`` Angstrom."
msgstr "返回每帧中距离不超过 ``cutoff`` 埃的水分子数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.coordination_by_cutoff:1
msgid "Return mean coordination count for each cutoff."
msgstr "返回每个截断距离的平均配位数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.select_representative_snapshot_indices:1
msgid "Select deterministic post-burn snapshots spanning shell occupancy."
msgstr "确定性地选择初始舍弃期后的快照，使其覆盖壳层占据情况。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.select_random_snapshot_indices:1
msgid "Select reproducible random snapshot indices from a trajectory window."
msgstr "从轨迹窗口中选择可复现的随机快照索引。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.state_to_symbols_coords:1
msgid "Convert one solvent-state frame to combined solute + TIP3P atom arrays."
msgstr "将一帧溶剂状态转换为合并的溶质和 TIP3P 原子数组。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.write_xyz_snapshot:1
msgid "Write one solute + solvent-shell frame as an XYZ file."
msgstr "将一帧溶质与溶剂壳层写为 XYZ 文件。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.xyz_atom_count:1
msgid "Return the atom count declared by an XYZ file."
msgstr "返回 XYZ 文件声明的原子数。"

#: of q2m3.solvation.structure_analysis.radial_profile_to_rows:1
msgid "Convert a radial profile to CSV-ready dictionaries."
msgstr "将径向分布转换为可写入 CSV 的字典。"

